"Jeremy Levi, called Remy, is Alden Thorn's friend and the funny one of the group."
"He joined the group as a high school freshman."
"His parents are both lawyers and leave cash lying around."
"His parents took law school classes on contracts between Artona and Earth."
"His mother is a neat freak; the family has pancake breakfasts and a home weight room."
"He has an older sister."
"Boe calls him rich boy."
"He owns creative ties, such as one printed with chocolate chip cookies."
"On a ten-dollar dare from Boe he wore flip-flops, shorts and a traffic-cone tee in the snow."
"He takes Beginners Wordchaining at the consulate because it has no homework."
"Alden finds him really likable and insightful."
"After Alden was chosen by the System, Jeremy took wordchain notes for him."
"While Alden lay unconscious after affixing, Jeremy tried to wordchain him awake."
"He punched a box Alden's skill was preserving and hurt his hand."
"He is three months older than Alden and has a slightly crooked nose from skateboarding."
"While Alden was presumed dead he used his messages to Alden as a diary and kept Victor."
"His mother has Aunt Connie over for dinner every other Saturday."
"His older sister is Sarah; he visited Alden on Anesidora that autumn."
"He started dating Kimberly Martinez, an older girl who asked him out at lunch."
"In the crisis he searched shelters for Victor, who reappeared in his room with three new dollars."
"He would be Alden's third evacuation pick."
